flowchart TD
    SPEC([RenderSpec · visual_palette · eval_gates]):::io --> SRC
    SRC[SourceStage · SourceRouter det]:::det --> SCR
    SCR[ScriptStage · ScriptService]:::ai --> DIR
    DIR[DirectorStage · DirectorLLM · animation-only]:::ai --> SCN
    SCN[SceneStage · SceneDefinitionAI to Storyboard]:::ai --> CHK
    CHK[ChunkStage · ChunkingAI plus assemble]:::ai --> AUD
    AUD[AudioStage · AudioGenerationModel · per chunk]:::ai --> ALN
    ALN[AlignStage · ASRModel · word timing]:::ai --> OVL
    OVL[OverlayStage · CaptionService det]:::det --> EV1
    AUD --> MUS[MusicStage · MusicBedService det]:::det --> EV1
    EV1{Eval Check · pre-compose}:::eval
    EV1 -.->|fail · retry with changes| CHK
    EV1 -->|pass| CMP
    CMP[ComposeStage · Compositor · renders chunk visuals plus composes all]:::det --> EV2
    EV2{Eval Checks · pre-upload}:::eval
    EV2 -.->|fail · retry| CHK
    EV2 -->|pass| UPL
    UPL[UploadStage · UploadService det]:::det --> DONE([UploadResult]):::io
    CMP --> CRT[CritiqueStage · CritiqueSkill]:::ai
    CRT -.->|findings to LearningsStore| SCR
    NOTE["Eval gates (HLD Eval Check / Eval Checks) are<br/>SKIPPED when RenderSpec.eval_gates = False"]:::note
    EV1 -.- NOTE
